  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Climate change and green transition</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The next two years will &#x2013; and must &#x2013; bring major changes in global climate action. Our climate action and green transition team wants to contribute to ambitious, fair and effective responses to the climate crisis, promote a green COVID-19 recovery and explore the European and African politics of green transition and renewable energy deployment.Topics we look at include:Climate finance in Africa-Europe relations and international cooperationThe geopolitics and external dimensions of EU climate, energy and green transition policies, including the European Green DealManagement of transboundary climate impacts &#x2013; focusing on adaptation and resilienceLocally led green transition and adaptation</narrative>
  </description>
